WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.804 --> 00:00:08.487
"Home, at last!"

2
00:00:19.052 --> 00:00:21.033
Ally smiled and looked out the window.

3
00:00:21.793 --> 00:00:28.396
After a long, twelve-hour flight from Patagonia, Lainie Polk's private jet had touched down at Sandville Airport.

4
00:00:29.532 --> 00:00:33.075
Ally couldn't wait to see Mateo and tell him that their plan had worked.

5
00:00:33.675 --> 00:00:38.358
During the solar eclipse in Patagonia, Ally's Astralian powers had come back!

6
00:00:38.378 --> 00:00:41.860
"What a relief," she thought.

7
00:00:43.081 --> 00:00:45.063
A crew member lowered the jet's stairs.

8
00:00:48.985 --> 00:00:51.867
for everything," Ally said as she left the plane.

9
00:00:52.368 --> 00:00:56.891
"This jet is much nicer than my family's ship—uh, I mean, car!"

10
00:01:00.680 --> 00:01:03.062
"Yikes." Ally slapped her forehead.

11
00:01:03.082 --> 00:01:08.046
"I'm so excited to have my powers back, I almost forgot that I'm still on Earth."

12
00:01:12.269 --> 00:01:14.350
Inside the airport, Ally looked around.

13
00:01:14.370 --> 00:01:19.314
"Hmm. Where do I get the bus to downtown?"

14
00:01:19.654 --> 00:01:20.094
she thought.

15
00:01:20.875 --> 00:01:23.817
Transportation always seemed so complicated on Earth.

16
00:01:24.518 --> 00:01:27.340
Back on Astralia, everyone had their own spaceships.

17
00:01:34.796 --> 00:01:40.058
Finally Ally saw a sign for the downtown bus.

18
00:01:41.559 --> 00:01:44.280
She was heading toward it when she spotted someone familiar.

19
00:01:44.300 --> 00:01:48.081
"Mateo! What's he doing here?"

20
00:01:49.642 --> 00:01:50.242
Ally giggled.

21
00:01:50.262 --> 00:01:53.904
"I'm not going to tell him I got my powers back.

22
00:01:54.684 --> 00:01:56.085
I'm going to show him!"

23
00:01:57.005 --> 00:02:01.347
Ally sneaked up behind a potted plant and threw her voice in Mateo's direction.

24
00:02:01.367 --> 00:02:03.908
"Mateo! Is that you?"

25
00:02:04.544 --> 00:02:05.645
Mateo spun around.

26
00:02:05.665 --> 00:02:11.230
"Huh?" Ally threw her voice in another direction.

27
00:02:11.250 --> 00:02:12.851
"Over here!"

28
00:02:13.872 --> 00:02:18.516
While Mateo spun around and around looking for her, Ally stepped up behind him.

29
00:02:18.536 --> 00:02:20.357
"Boo!" "Ahh!"

30
00:02:20.597 --> 00:02:21.358
Mateo jumped.

31
00:02:22.799 --> 00:02:24.420
"Ally! You scared me!"

32
00:02:24.440 --> 00:02:26.802
"Sorry!" Ally grinned.

33
00:02:26.822 --> 00:02:30.485
"I wanted to show you that I got my powers back."

34
00:02:30.505 --> 00:02:37.630
"That's great news, but Mateo's expression was serious—very serious.

35
00:02:37.650 --> 00:02:39.971
"We've got another big problem.

36
00:02:41.012 --> 00:02:42.873
That's why I'm here to meet you."

37
00:02:43.833 --> 00:02:44.774
Ally's heart sunk.

38
00:02:44.794 --> 00:02:47.255
"Did something happen at the diner?"

39
00:02:47.275 --> 00:02:49.797
"I'll tell you about it on the way home.

40
00:02:50.397 --> 00:02:51.598
Come on, let's go."

41
00:02:54.159 --> 00:02:58.281
Mateo was leading Ally toward the bus stop when she spotted another familiar face.

42
00:02:58.301 --> 00:03:00.742
"Is that Tina?"

43
00:03:00.762 --> 00:03:05.153
"I think so," Mateo said, but we have to hurry.

44
00:03:05.653 --> 00:03:08.775
Our bus arrives in—" "Look, she's waving at us."

45
00:03:09.996 --> 00:03:10.837
Ally waved back.

46
00:03:10.857 --> 00:03:13.559
"It would be rude not to say hello.

47
00:03:14.359 --> 00:03:15.160
I'll be right back."

48
00:03:15.940 --> 00:03:16.681
Ally ran over.

49
00:03:16.701 --> 00:03:18.982
"Hi, Tina.

50
00:03:19.362 --> 00:03:21.224
You're not leaving town already, are you?

51
00:03:22.284 --> 00:03:23.185
You just got here."

52
00:03:23.205 --> 00:03:26.887
"Uh, no Tina hesitated.

53
00:03:26.907 --> 00:03:30.670
"I'm just here to pick up a package for the museum."

54
00:03:30.690 --> 00:03:33.352
"Cool," Ally said.

55
00:03:33.952 --> 00:03:35.713
"Well, I've got to get the bus.

56
00:03:36.534 --> 00:03:37.715
See you soon at the diner!"

57
00:03:37.735 --> 00:03:41.337
"Nice to, um, bump into you," Tina said.

58
00:03:43.218 --> 00:03:44.659
Mateo grabbed Ally's arm.

59
00:03:45.059 --> 00:03:47.461
"Ally. We have to—" "Ally, Mateo!

60
00:03:48.962 --> 00:03:49.723
What are you doing here?"

61
00:03:50.183 --> 00:03:51.104
Barry hurried over.

62
00:03:51.124 --> 00:03:52.985
"Did you come to see me off?"

63
00:03:53.005 --> 00:03:56.327
"Wow!" Ally was amazed.

64
00:03:56.347 --> 00:03:58.809
"Everyone is here today.

65
00:03:59.229 --> 00:04:00.430
Where are you going, Barry?"

66
00:04:00.450 --> 00:04:03.652
"My dad is taking me to Italy," Barry said.

67
00:04:04.252 --> 00:04:06.313
"I can't wait to taste all the delicious food!

68
00:04:06.813 --> 00:04:08.173
Oops, my flight is boarding now.

69
00:04:08.533 --> 00:04:08.953
Gotta go!"

70
00:04:08.973 --> 00:04:10.094
"Have fun!"

71
00:04:10.674 --> 00:04:11.734
Ally waved good-bye.

72
00:04:11.754 --> 00:04:14.695
"Ally, our bus!"

73
00:04:15.215 --> 00:04:15.875
Mateo said.

74
00:04:15.895 --> 00:04:19.316
"Run!" Ally and Mateo raced to the bus.

75
00:04:20.577 --> 00:04:25.518
Once they were onboard, Mateo chose two seats in the far back, away from other passengers.

76
00:04:26.478 --> 00:04:27.678
He kept his voice low.

77
00:04:27.698 --> 00:04:29.739
"Here's the bad news.

78
00:04:30.359 --> 00:04:33.160
Alpha detected an alien life-form in Sandville."

79
00:04:34.152 --> 00:04:35.833
"Oh, I know about that already."

80
00:04:36.453 --> 00:04:37.054
Ally shrugged.

81
00:04:37.074 --> 00:04:38.674
"It's just a rock."

82
00:04:39.875 --> 00:04:40.916
Mateo shook his head.

83
00:04:40.936 --> 00:04:43.077
"This is not a rock.

84
00:04:44.838 --> 00:04:46.759
It's a Jorgandian life-form.

85
00:04:47.439 --> 00:04:48.820
Alpha is certain of it."

86
00:04:48.840 --> 00:04:53.783
"What? A Jorgandian is here in Sandville?"

87
00:04:54.863 --> 00:04:55.884
Ally gripped his arm.

88
00:04:55.904 --> 00:04:59.306
"Jorgandians have vowed to destroy Astralia!

89
00:05:00.046 --> 00:05:03.168
And if there's one in Sandville, it might be able to detect me.

90
00:05:03.796 --> 00:05:05.317
No wonder you came to get me!

91
00:05:05.978 --> 00:05:09.140
This is bad really, really bad!"

92
00:05:11.863 --> 00:05:15.465
As soon as Ally and Mateo got home, Ally turned Alpha on.

93
00:05:15.486 --> 00:05:21.690
"Alpha, are you certain you detected a Jorgandian in Sandville?"

94
00:05:21.710 --> 00:05:26.895
"Affirmative. Repeated scans have picked up a Jorgandian life-form."

95
00:05:26.915 --> 00:05:28.516
"Where is it?"

96
00:05:28.976 --> 00:05:29.557
Ally asked.

97
00:05:29.577 --> 00:05:31.218
"And when did it arrive?"

98
00:05:32.139 --> 00:05:33.400
Alpha sounded frustrated.

99
00:05:34.048 --> 00:05:38.290
"Without my original components, I am unable to pinpoint its exact location.

100
00:05:39.011 --> 00:05:42.093
I can, however, estimate it has been here a few weeks."

101
00:05:43.253 --> 00:05:44.074
Mateo frowned.

102
00:05:44.714 --> 00:05:46.095
"That's not very helpful.

103
00:05:46.515 --> 00:05:47.736
This is a big town.

104
00:05:48.596 --> 00:05:51.898
Plus, it's summertime, so there are lots of tourists here.

105
00:05:52.498 --> 00:05:54.920
You saw how crowded the airport was today, Ally."

106
00:05:56.540 --> 00:05:57.801
Alpha's screen flashed.

107
00:05:58.562 --> 00:06:04.557
"It is imperative you find the Jorgandian before it finds you, Allyzooba."

108
00:06:04.577 --> 00:06:07.261
"Why? It wouldn't try to hurt her, would it?"

109
00:06:07.662 --> 00:06:08.443
Mateo asked.

110
00:06:09.384 --> 00:06:12.308
Ally bit her lip, waiting anxiously for the reply.

111
00:06:12.328 --> 00:06:16.033
"'Hurt' is not the correct term," Alpha said.

112
00:06:16.053 --> 00:06:20.360
"Allyzooba, the Jorgandian will attempt to evaporate you."
